   "msg": "0x1662"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_007003:0x19e24",
   "off": 106020,
   "max": 28,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "なにしやがるっ！\\n待て！",
   "en": "What the hell are\\nyou doing!? Wait!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x1663"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_007003:0x1a5b4",
   "off": 107956,
   "max": 16,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "龍馬くんっ！",
   "en": "Ryoma-kun!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x1664"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_007003:0x1ae98",
   "off": 110232,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "追いかけた\\n高杉たちの前に\\n何人もの武士が現れた",
   "en": "As Takasugi and\\nthe others gave\\nchase, a crowd of\\nsamurai appeared\\nbefore them.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x1665"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_007003:0x1aedc",
   "off": 110300,
   "max": 64,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "それだけではない\\n今までじっと座っていた\\n観客達が立ちあがり",
   "en": "And that wasn't\\nall. The audience,\\nwho had sat\\nperfectly still\\nuntil now, rose to\\ntheir feet...",
